        <h2 id="turnkey-release-title">Релизы<br />под ключ</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="turnkey-release-summary">
        <p>
          Могу полностью взять релиз на себя — от подбора материала и команды
          до готовой мастер-версии, которую остаётся только принять и выпустить.
        </p>
        <div class="turnkey-release-actions">
          <a class="button light" href="/contact">Обсудить релиз</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/works">Смотреть релизы ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="turnkey-release-steps">
      <li>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Материал</h3>
        <p>Подберу исходный материал под задачу и согласую формат будущего релиза.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Команда</h3>
        <p>Найду подходящих актёров, распределю роли и организую процесс записи.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Озвучивание</h3>
        <p>Запишем актёров и проконтролируем цельность актёрской подачи.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Постпродакшн</h3>
        <p>Очищу фонограммы от артефактов, выполню перезапись и при необходимости локализую надписи.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Сдача</h3>
        <p>Подготовлю мастер-файл в нужном формате и передам готовый материал.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="journal" class="shell section">
    <div class="section-head section-head--compact">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Блог</p>
        <h2>Заметки и новости</h2>
        <a class="section-more-link" href="/journal">Просмотреть все публикации →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coming-grid">
      {
        latestJournalPosts.map((post) => (
          <a class="coming-card coming-card--news" href={`/journal/${post.id}`}>
            <div class="coming-banner coming-banner--news">
              {post.data.poster && (
                <img
                  src={post.data.poster}
                  alt=""
                  width={post.data.posterWidth}
                  height={post.data.posterHeight}
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
              )}
            </div>
            <div class="coming-meta">
              <h3>{post.data.title}</h3>
              <p>{post.data.description}</p>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))
      }

      {
        journalPlaceholders.map(() => (
          <article class="coming-card coming-card--placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="coming-banner">Скоро...</div>
            <div class="coming-meta">
              <h3>Скоро...</h3>
              <p>Скоро...</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="shell manifesto-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">Подход</p>

      <blockquote>
        «Лучшая озвучка та,
        которую зритель даже не заметил».
      </blockquote>

      <div>
        <p>
          Медицинская база дополняет актерскую игру — понимая 
          физиологию дыхания и голосового аппарата, я добиваюсь 
          нужного звука за счет правильной работы мышц. 
          А опыт звукорежиссера позволяет свести этот исходник так, 
          чтобы голос стал абсолютно естественной частью видеоряда.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/approach">
          Как я строю персонажа ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section split-callout">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Два ремесла</p>
      <h2>
        В кадре — актёр.<br />
        За кадром — звукорежиссёр.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="discipline-list">
      <a href="/works">
        <span>01</span>
        <b>Озвучивание</b>
        <p>Дикторская начитка, закадровый перевод, рекаст, дубляж.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/works">
        <span>02</span>
        <b>Звукорежиссура</b>
        <p>Чистка записи, саунд-дизайн, сведение дубляжа, липсинка и закадра.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/journal">
        <span>03</span>
        <b>Авторство</b>
        <p>Песни, рассказы, статьи, блоги.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline data-astro-rerun>
    (() => {
    const rawAudio = document.querySelector('#demo-raw');
    const studioAudio = document.querySelector('#demo-studio');
    const playButton = document.querySelector('#play');
    const modeButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.audio-mode-switch button');
    const player = document.querySelector('.audio-compare-player');
    const waveSeek = document.querySelector('#wave-seek');
    const bars = document.querySelectorAll('#wave-seek i');
    const timeCurrent = document.querySelector('#time-current');
    const timeDuration = document.querySelector('#time-duration');

    let activeMode = 'raw';
    let activeAudio = rawAudio;

    document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => {
      rawAudio?.pause();
      studioAudio?.pause();
    }, { once: true });

    const formatTime = (seconds) => {
      if (!Number.isFinite(seconds)) {
        return '0:00';
      }

      const minutes = Math.floor(seconds / 60);
      const rest = Math.floor(seconds % 60).toString().padStart(2, '0');

      return `${minutes}:${rest}`;
    };

    const paintBars = () => {
      if (!activeAudio || !activeAudio.duration) {
        return;
      }

      const progress = activeAudio.currentTime / activeAudio.duration;

      bars.forEach((bar, index) => {
        const barProgress = index / Math.max(1, bars.length - 1);
        bar.classList.toggle('played', barProgress <= progress);
      });

      if (timeCurrent) {
        timeCurrent.textContent = formatTime(activeAudio.currentTime);
      }

      if (timeDuration) {
        timeDuration.textContent = formatTime(activeAudio.duration);
      }
    };

    const setPlayingState = (isPlaying) => {
      playButton?.classList.toggle('is-playing', isPlaying);
    };

    const syncInactiveAudio = () => {
      const inactiveAudio = activeMode === 'raw' ? studioAudio : rawAudio;

      if (inactiveAudio && activeAudio) {
        inactiveAudio.currentTime = activeAudio.currentTime;
      }
    };

    const switchMode = async (nextMode) => {
      if (nextMode === activeMode) {
        return;
      }

      const wasPlaying = !activeAudio.paused;
      const currentTime = activeAudio.currentTime;

      activeAudio.pause();

      activeMode = nextMode;
      activeAudio = nextMode === 'raw' ? rawAudio : studioAudio;

      activeAudio.currentTime = Math.min(currentTime, activeAudio.duration || currentTime);

      player?.setAttribute('data-active', nextMode);

      modeButtons.forEach((button) => {
        button.classList.toggle('active', button.dataset.mode === nextMode);
      });

      paintBars();

      if (wasPlaying) {
        await activeAudio.play();
        setPlayingState(true);
      }
    };

    [rawAudio, studioAudio].forEach((audio) => {
      audio?.addEventListener('loadedmetadata', paintBars);

      audio?.addEventListener('timeupdate', () => {
        if (audio === activeAudio) {
          paintBars();
          syncInactiveAudio();
        }
      });

      audio?.addEventListener('ended', () => {
        if (audio === activeAudio) {
          setPlayingState(false);
          paintBars();
        }
      });
    });

    playButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (activeAudio.paused) {
        await activeAudio.play();
        setPlayingState(true);
      } else {
        activeAudio.pause();
        setPlayingState(false);
      }
    });

    modeButtons.forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener('click', () => switchMode(button.dataset.mode));
    });

    waveSeek?.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
      if (!activeAudio.duration) {
        return;
      }

      const rect = waveSeek.getBoundingClientRect();
      const ratio = (event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width;
      const nextTime = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, ratio)) * activeAudio.duration;

      rawAudio.currentTime = nextTime;
      studioAudio.currentTime = nextTime;
      paintBars();
    });
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
    .voice-inner > div:first-child > p:last-child {
      font-size: 17px !important;
      line-height: 1.55 !important;
    }

    .manifesto-grid > div {
      width: calc(100% + 54px);
      transform: translateX(-70px);
    }

    .manifesto-grid > div p {
      font-size: 16px !important;
      line-height: 1.55 !important;
      hyphens: none !important;
      overflow-wrap: normal !important;
      text-align: left !important;
    }

    .manifesto-grid blockquote {
      align-self: center;
      text-align: center;
      transform: translateX(-72px);
    }

    @media (min-width: 761px) {
      .discipline-list {
        width: calc(100% + 80px);
        transform: translateX(-80px);
      }

      .discipline-list a span {
        font-size: 13px !important;
      }

      .discipline-list a b {
        font-size: 17px !important;
        line-height: 1.25 !important;
      }

      .discipline-list a p {
        font-size: 14px !important;
        line-height: 1.5 !important;
      }
    }

    .turnkey-release {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding-top: 88px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .turnkey-release::before {
      content: "ПОД КЛЮЧ";
      position: absolute;
      top: 56px;
      right: -8px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
      font-size: clamp(72px, 11vw, 164px);
      line-height: 0.8;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.08em;
      white-space: nowrap;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .turnkey-release-intro {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(320px, 1.15fr);
      gap: 72px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
    }

    .turnkey-release h2 {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 62px);
      line-height: 0.96;
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    }

    .turnkey-release-summary {
      padding-top: 28px;
    }

    .turnkey-release-summary > p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #d4d4d4;
      font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .turnkey-release-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      list-style: none;
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps li {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 24px 22px 0 0;
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps li + li {
      padding-left: 22px;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .turnkey-release-steps p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .turnkey-release {
        padding-top: 72px;
      }

      .turnkey-release-intro {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .turnkey-release-summary {
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps li,
      .turnkey-release-steps li + li {
        padding: 22px 22px 24px 0;
        border-left: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps li:nth-child(even) {
        padding-left: 22px;
        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps span {
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .manifesto-grid > div {
        width: auto;
        transform: none;
      }

      .manifesto-grid blockquote {
        transform: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .voice-inner > div:first-child > p:last-child {
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }

      .turnkey-release {
        padding-top: 64px;
      }

      .turnkey-release-intro {
        margin-bottom: 38px;
      }

      .turnkey-release h2 {
        font-size: clamp(34px, 11vw, 46px);
      }

      .turnkey-release-summary > p {
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .turnkey-release-actions {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-start;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps li,
      .turnkey-release-steps li + li,
      .turnkey-release-steps li:nth-child(even) {
        padding: 20px 0 22px;
        border-left: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps li:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .turnkey-release-steps span {
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }
    }

    .coming-card--news {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .coming-meta h3 {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 20px !important;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .coming-meta p {
      overflow: hidden;
      max-width: 100%;
      font-size: 16px !important;
      line-height: 1.5;
      hyphens: none !important;
      overflow-wrap: normal !important;
      text-overflow: ellipsis !important;
      text-wrap: nowrap !important;
      white-space: nowrap !important;
    }

    .coming-banner--news {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), transparent 42%),
        #101010;
      transition:
        border-color 0.16s ease,
        background 0.16s ease,
        transform 0.16s ease;
    }

    .coming-banner--news span {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      height: 26px;
      padding: 0 9px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #dcdcdc;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .coming-banner--news b {
      max-width: 260px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.02;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .coming-card--news:hover .coming-banner--news {
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.12), transparent 42%),
        #121212;
      transform: none;
    }

    .coming-card--news:hover .coming-meta h3 {
      color: #fff;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .coming-banner--news b {
        font-size: 28px;
      }
    }

    .coming-banner--news {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .coming-banner--news img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -2;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.05);
      opacity: 0.48;
      transition: opacity 0.18s ease;
    }

    .coming-banner--news::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 68% 28%, rgba(255,255,255,0.10), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.18), rgba(0,0,0,0.78));
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .coming-card--news:hover .coming-banner--news img {
      opacity: 0.62;
    }


    /* News preview: no zoom / no movement on hover */
    .coming-card--news,
    .coming-card--news:hover,
    .coming-card--news .coming-banner--news,
    .coming-card--news:hover .coming-banner--news,
    .coming-card--news .coming-banner--news img,
    .coming-card--news:hover .coming-banner--news img {
      transform: none !important;
    }

    .coming-banner--news img {
      transition: opacity 0.18s ease !important;
    }


    /* News preview image only: text lives below the poster */
    .coming-banner--news > span,
    .coming-banner--news > b {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .coming-banner--news,
    .coming-banner--news:hover,
    .coming-banner--news img,
    .coming-banner--news:hover img,
    .coming-card--news,
    .coming-card--news:hover {
      transform: none !important;
    }

